  m_text: Methicillin-Resistant Staphylococcus aureus (MRSA) appears in the game
    as a hardened elite enemy shaped by countless failed attempts to destroy it.
    It resists conventional attacks and adapts rapidly to incoming threats. Entering
    through wounds and close contact, it builds fortified strongholds that are difficult
    to break. Relentless and unforgiving, MRSA tests both strategy and patience.
    It represents the danger of enemies forged through resistance.
