  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Class:</b> Polymyxin antibiotic (last-line drug)



    <b>Indications:</b>

    Serious
    infections caused by multidrug-resistant Gram-negative bacteria, including carbapenem-resistant
    Acinetobacter baumannii (CRAB), when other options have failed



    <b>Target
    Bacteria:</b>

    Acinetobacter baumannii (CRAB), Pseudomonas aeruginosa (MDR),
    Klebsiella pneumoniae (carbapenem-resistant)



    <b>Adverse Drug Reactions
    (ADR):</b>

    Nephrotoxicity (common, dose-limiting), neurotoxicity (paresthesia,
    dizziness), respiratory depression (rare), hypersensitivity reactions



    <b>LINK:</b>

    <link="https://www.rxlist.com/coly-mycin-m-drug.htm">Click
    here to see more</link>

'
