      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Class:</b> Oxazolidinone antibiotic



    <b>Indications:</b>

    Vancomycin-resistant
    Enterococcus faecium (VRE) infections, community-acquired and nosocomial pneumonia,
    complicated skin and soft tissue infections including MRSA



    <b>Target Bacteria:</b>

    Enterococcus
    faecium (VRE), Staphylococcus aureus (including MRSA), Streptococcus pneumoniae,
    Streptococcus pyogenes



    <b>Adverse Drug Reactions (ADR):</b>

    Thrombocytopenia,
    peripheral/optic neuropathy (prolonged use), serotonin syndrome (with serotonergic
    drugs), gastrointestinal disturbances



    <b>LINK:</b>

    <link="https://www.rxlist.com/zyvox-drug.htm">Click
    here to see more</link>

'
