      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Moracella xataralis appears in the game as an opportunistic enemy hiding
    in the upper airways. It remains quiet and unnoticed, blending into its surroundings
    while waiting for the host\u2019s defenses to weaken. When the moment comes,
    it turns aggressive and spreads through the sinuses, ears, and lungs. This enemy
    causes persistent inflammation that clogs passages and slows recovery. Moraxella
    catarrhalis teaches players that threats which seem harmless can become dangerous
    when vigilance fades."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3914de223fa8efc4787902589e5d6968, type: 2}
