  m_text: '<b>Class:</b> Tetracycline antibiotic



    <b>Indications:</b>

    Chlamydia
    trachomatis infections, acne, respiratory tract infections, Lyme disease, malaria
    prophylaxis



    <b>Target Bacteria:</b>

    Chlamydia trachomatis, Mycoplasma
    pneumoniae, Rickettsia spp., Borrelia burgdorferi



    <b>Adverse Drug Reactions
    (ADR):</b>

    Photosensitivity, gastrointestinal disturbances, esophageal irritation,
    tooth discoloration (contraindicated in children and pregnancy), dizziness (vestibular
    effects)



    <b>LINK:</b>

    <link="https://www.rxlist.com/vibramycin-drug.htm">Click
    here to see more</link>

'
